{"hero":"<img loading=\"eager\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/42f73c9681e106482b86.webp\" alt=\"Lives Lived Well case study cover\" class=\"health-opening-image\">","about":"<div class=\"content-align-right\"><div class=\"copy-block\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\">about</h3><p class=\"body-copy-large\">We redesigned the Lives Lived Well website to make self-referral easier to find, understand and start. My contribution to the team project included grouping related services under clearer navigation labels.</p></div></div>","subtitle":"<h2 class=\"subtitle\">A clearer path from finding support to starting a self-referral.</h2>","body":"<div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section llw-story-section\">\n<figure id=\"llw-company-logo\" class=\"health-panel\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#fff;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/58f119788b10ccca3c5d.png\" width=\"2048\" height=\"454\" alt=\"Lives Lived Well company logo\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain\" loading=\"eager\"></figure></div></div><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section llw-story-section\"><div data-wf--section-header--variant=\"horizontal\" class=\"section-copy-wrap llw-userflows-heading\"><h1 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">01</span>userflows</h1><div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">We mapped the journey from finding support to starting the form. The flow helped us decide where to explain self-referral and what to show people next.</p></div></div><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Self-referral · User flow</figcaption><img loading=\"eager\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/10a47d08198fd87a10ea.webp\" alt=\"Lives Lived Well self-referral flow\" class=\"health-panel-image\" width=\"3364\" height=\"1392\"></figure>\n<section class=\"health-system-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"health-before-title\">\n\n<div class=\"health-wireframe-pair\"><figure class=\"health-panel\">\n<figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Before · Self-referral page</figcaption>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lives Lived Well live Refer Yourself page, captured November 2026\" viewbox=\"70 0 1192.905882 926\" width=\"876\" height=\"680\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/5da181b56deb3892f747.jpg\" width=\"1348\" height=\"926\"></image></svg></figure>\n<figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">After · Self-referral page</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Final desktop Refer Yourself page from Figma, showing the explanation and start of the contact form\" viewbox=\"0 0 1440 1117.808\" width=\"876\" height=\"680\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/782346905df20261083a.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2596\"></image></svg></figure></div></section><div class=\"caption\">\n<p class=\"body-copy-small\">People were unsure what self-referral meant or where to start.</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy-small\">We put two plain-language explanations above the form: what self-referral means and why someone might need it.</p>\n</div><section class=\"two-column-content health-architecture-intro\" aria-labelledby=\"llw-ia-title\" style=\"margin-top:clamp(24px,4vw,48px)\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Proposed sitemap</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/ac5bab6a1a3b927300b5.webp\" width=\"1299\" height=\"1650\" alt=\"Lives Lived Well sitemap from Figma showing the main service and referral routes\" loading=\"eager\"></figure><div class=\"copy-block\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"llw-ia-title\">information architecture</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Card sorting helped us group related services under Get Support. From there, people can browse by need or go straight to Refer Yourself.</p></div></section></div></div><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section llw-story-section\"><div data-wf--section-header--variant=\"horizontal\" class=\"section-copy-wrap\"><h1 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">02</span>wireframes</h1></div><div data-wf--content-block--variant=\"left-aligned\" class=\"content-block right-aligned\"><section class=\"llw-artboard\" aria-label=\"Homepage wireframes\"><h2 class=\"health-panel-title llw-artboard-label\">Homepage wireframes</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.81295fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(8px,2vw,24px);align-items:start;width:min(100%,860px);margin-inline:auto\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Desktop · Homepage</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/b3eccd9387d8af2e1454.webp\" width=\"576\" height=\"1112\" alt=\"Low fidelity desktop homepage wireframe\" loading=\"eager\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Mobile · Homepage</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:#fff\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/5d8dd477736e808f5429.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"1120\" alt=\"Low fidelity mobile homepage wireframe\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></section><div class=\"caption llw-wireframe-caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The desktop and mobile wireframes show how people can find support from the homepage on either screen size.</p></div><section aria-labelledby=\"llw-navigation-title\" style=\"margin-top:clamp(20px,3vw,40px)\"><div class=\"health-wireframe-pair\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Desktop · Service navigation wireframe</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/5e9d77e0e7e72053cd8d.webp\" width=\"864\" height=\"615\" alt=\"Low fidelity navigation with grouped service categories\" loading=\"eager\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"align-self:start\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">After · Desktop navigation</figcaption><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1440/1030;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--case-media-radius,10px)\"><img style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/39af3a855145618bf036.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2751\" alt=\"Updated desktop navigation with the Get Support menu open above the homepage hero and service cards\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></figure></div><div class=\"caption\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"llw-navigation-title\">navigation</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">I grouped related services under clearer labels. Refer Yourself sits under Get Support, while Get Help has its own button in the header.</p></div></section></div></div></div><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section llw-story-section\"><div data-wf--section-header--variant=\"horizontal\" class=\"section-copy-wrap\"><h1 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">03</span>design system</h1></div><div data-wf--content-block--variant=\"right-aligned\" class=\"content-block health-system-overview\"><style>.llw-system-mosaic{display:grid;width:100%;max-width:none;align-self:stretch;margin-inline:0;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,42fr) minmax(0,19fr) minmax(0,37fr);gap:10px;align-items:stretch;border-radius:var(--case-media-radius,10px);overflow:hidden}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-left,.llw-system-mosaic .ds-middle,.llw-system-mosaic .ds-lower,.llw-system-mosaic .ds-detail{display:grid;gap:10px;min-width:0}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-left{grid-template-rows:auto 1fr}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-lower{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.35fr)}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-middle{grid-template-rows:minmax(min-content,.8fr) minmax(min-content,1.2fr);align-content:stretch}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-detail{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-template-rows:auto minmax(min-content,1fr);align-content:stretch;align-self:stretch}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-detail-wide{grid-column:1/-1;min-width:0;display:grid;align-content:center;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 8%)}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-board{background:#eae7df;padding:clamp(7px,1vw,13px);min-width:0;border-radius:var(--case-media-radius,10px)}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-nav img{max-width:100%;max-height:clamp(130px,20vw,290px);object-fit:contain;object-position:left top}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-middle figure>div img{max-height:clamp(120px,18vw,250px);object-fit:contain;object-position:left top}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-detail figure img{max-height:clamp(160px,22vw,300px);object-fit:contain;object-position:left top}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-flow{min-width:0}.llw-system-mosaic figure.health-panel{margin:0 0 13px;padding:0;min-width:0;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:0}.llw-system-mosaic figure.health-panel:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.llw-system-mosaic figure .health-panel-title{background:none;margin:0 0 5px;padding:0;font-size:clamp(10px,.9vw,13px);line-height:1.2}.llw-system-mosaic figure :is(img,svg){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;border-radius:0!important}@media(max-width:680px){.llw-system-mosaic{grid-template-columns:1fr}.llw-system-mosaic :is(.ds-middle,.ds-detail){grid-template-rows:auto auto}.llw-system-mosaic .ds-board{padding:12px}}</style><div class=\"llw-system-mosaic\"><div class=\"ds-left\"><div class=\"ds-board ds-nav\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Organisms · Desktop and mobile navigation</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/8c368501d658f52380de.png\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1537\" alt=\"Organisms · Desktop and mobile navigation from the Lives Lived Well Figma component library\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div><div class=\"ds-lower\"><div class=\"ds-board\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Buttons</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/352f575bab9ab818e79b.png\" width=\"882\" height=\"441\" alt=\"Buttons and their interaction states from Figma\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Button styles</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Button styles\" viewbox=\"857 1093 829 78\" width=\"829\" height=\"78\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Iconography</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Iconography\" viewbox=\"478 450 312 197\" width=\"312\" height=\"197\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure></div><div class=\"ds-board\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Atoms</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/c1f608ace108282ad331.png\" width=\"1660\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"Atoms from the Lives Lived Well Figma component library\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Brand logo</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brand logo\" viewbox=\"462 136 377 248\" width=\"377\" height=\"248\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure></div><div class=\"ds-board\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Colour palette &amp; interaction colours</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brand colours\" viewbox=\"872 149 644 137\" width=\"644\" height=\"137\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brand colours\" viewbox=\"1516 149 484 137\" width=\"484\" height=\"137\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Interaction colours\" viewbox=\"870 309 444 155\" width=\"444\" height=\"155\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Colour gradient\" viewbox=\"1367 310 301 144\" width=\"301\" height=\"144\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Body copy</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Body copy\" viewbox=\"33 1095 407 112\" width=\"407\" height=\"112\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ds-middle\"><div class=\"ds-board\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Molecules</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/c22c7343c4cce4597b7e.png\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1542\" alt=\"Molecules from the Lives Lived Well Figma component library\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div><div class=\"ds-board\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Service sliders · Desktop and mobile</figcaption><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;align-items:start\"><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:#fff\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/f9d52e30adbff2ecbfff.png\" width=\"964\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"Desktop service slider variants\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:#fff\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/cdb6807864f103c48fe7.png\" width=\"363\" height=\"782\" alt=\"Mobile service slider variants\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></figure></div></div><div class=\"ds-board ds-detail\"><div class=\"ds-flow\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Type hierarchy</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Headlines &amp; subheadings\" viewbox=\"28 641 412 105\" width=\"412\" height=\"105\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Supporting typography\" viewbox=\"28 779 412 223\" width=\"412\" height=\"223\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Form fields</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/88eb25420417c49cd3cc.png\" width=\"1571\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"Form fields and their interaction states from Figma\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div><div class=\"ds-flow\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Selection controls</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/405f2b0008ddaf4a40cb.png\" width=\"1060\" height=\"790\" alt=\"Selection controls and their interaction states from Figma\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Button states</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Default &amp; hover states\" viewbox=\"465 750 357 173\" width=\"357\" height=\"173\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Focus, active &amp; disabled states\" viewbox=\"465 937 357 266\" width=\"357\" height=\"266\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px\"><image href=\"__LLW_STYLE_TILE__\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1220\"></image></svg></figure></div><div class=\"ds-detail-wide\"><figure class=\"health-panel llw-artboard-item\" style=\"min-width:0\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Content sliders</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:#fff\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/d220dd20f3ed626e7def.png\" width=\"1498\" height=\"808\" alt=\"Quote slider variants\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The grouped board shows how reusable components fit together across the site. In the self-referral form, consistent fields, selection controls and button states show people where to enter information, make choices and continue.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"caption llw-video-caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">In the prototype, follow Get Support → Refer Yourself to see how the page explains self-referral before introducing the form.</p></div><div class=\"health-walkthrough\"><video class=\"health-walkthrough-video\" autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"Desktop prototype walkthrough: Home, Get Support, Refer Yourself and Get Help\" poster=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/cdd56f3435627b920021.jpg\"><source src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/1fbc1841e39766523656.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></source></video></div>","labels":["userflows","wireframes","design system"],"styleTile":"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/87d31fc44532cf1cb627.png"}